 on all these things\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3363330, "dDurationMs": 6240, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's I think the video that I posted this morning for wild wellness was all about that like self love or self hate\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3369570, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "You have a choice\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3371650, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, break down the video. I didn't watch it. Okay, so\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3375120, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Mind you I edited a couple this morning too\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3377040, "dDurationMs": 5840, "segs": [{"utf8": "So the one that I believe that was posted this morning was the self love and self hate and I think I started it off by saying like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3384150, "dDurationMs": 5200, "segs": [{"utf8": "If you wanted to help someone or rather point someone's behavior out to get them to change\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3390310, "dDurationMs": 2450, "segs": [{"utf8": "What would work better?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3392760, "dDurationMs": 3920, "segs": [{"utf8": "Calling them out calling them stupid that idiot or saying like hey, I noticed this\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3397510, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "This is you know bothering me. What can we do to solve that?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3400070, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like which one of those would actually have a better outcome obvious\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3404230, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, the second option and so why do we do that to ourselves?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3408950, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Why do we think that calling ourselves a stupid idiot in the gym or like calling?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3413110, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "I have guilty of that like grabbing my own fat and saying like oh god, I'm disgusting\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3416710, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "I need to go to the gym joke about it self deprecating joke. It's awful\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3421030, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "And it is something that it's a habit to break\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3424070, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "And that's like my specialization with my coaching. I'm a habit change specialist\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3428870, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "Because it's um the choices that we make over and over and over that become our habits\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3432550, "dDurationMs": 5280, "segs": [{"utf8": "And when we get stuck in certain habit loops, that's when we notice that we are gaining a little bit of weight\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3437910, "dDurationMs": 1120, "segs": [{"utf8": "Or we are more negative\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3439030, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "But if you can break that cycle by making another choice\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3442470, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "And another choice and another choice your habits will shift and you'll be a different person\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3447270, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "Just in the gym. So if you notice that's what it is\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3450310, "dDurationMs": 1440, "segs": [{"utf8": "So we're often\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3451750, "dDurationMs": 4960, "segs": [{"utf8": "Either completely oblivious to what we're doing and then there starts to be this judgmental side of us\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3456950, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's like, oh my god, I'm\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3459110, "dDurationMs": 4480, "segs": [{"utf8": "I am being a jerk to myself that why am I I'm gonna keep doing it because it obviously works\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3464310, "dDurationMs": 4800, "segs": [{"utf8": "And then if you can go one step beyond that and be curious like why am I being a jerk to myself?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3469430, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Is there another way?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3471880, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "Is there a different way?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3473800, "dDurationMs": 3360, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, there's other choices to make and they're like, but I don't I don't know\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3478280, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "What that will bring me. Okay, so\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3480920, "dDurationMs": 3520, "segs": [{"utf8": "A visualization for this is say you're walking through a jungle\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3485300, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "And there's already a path\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3487380, "dDurationMs": 4800, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's blazed you want to take that because you know how you know everything about it. It's the easiest route\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3492740, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "But what if what you actually want\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3495620, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "Is just a little like bush whack away\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3497300, "dDurationMs": 6160, "segs": [{"utf8": "You just have to like clip clip away at the vines and everything and blaze a new trail to what you actually desire\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3504340, "dDurationMs": 2190, "segs": [{"utf8": "That happens with habit change\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3506610, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "So like at the gym if you're sitting there being rude to yourself\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3511970, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Notice it acknowledge\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3514930, "dDurationMs": 2640, "segs": [{"utf8": "What you're trying to do you're like, oh i'm trying to motivate myself\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3518210, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "But there is another way so let's try it\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3521540, "dDurationMs": 5280, "segs": [{"utf8": "And so that's what I've I had to do that because I've gained and lost like 70 pounds a couple times now\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3527300, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "And with my neck injury. I had to slow down at the gym\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3530180, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "I did get you know kind of sad about it\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3532660, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "So I was eating differently even though that doesn't help me\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3535540, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "But then I realized what was happening getting control of it again\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3538980, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "I started to be mean to myself. I started to notice and now I'm like no\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3542900, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Look at how cool my body is\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3545060, "dDurationMs": 4960, "segs": [{"utf8": "Anytime my neck starts to flare up. It's giving me a signal. Yeah, I like that. Look how cool my body is\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3550020, "dDurationMs": 4720, "segs": [{"utf8": "I like that. Yeah, like huge mindset. I can I can run. I can run more than I think that I can\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3554900, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "I can lift more than I think that I can\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3557540, "dDurationMs": 2960, "segs": [{"utf8": "I can um\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3560500, "dDurationMs": 5680, "segs": [{"utf8": "It is so interesting how if you take an ailment like your stomach is aching or your heart is racing\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3567250, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "And you actually ask why or what could I do?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3571330, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "You give yourself some power back\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3573730, "dDurationMs": 4480, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like it's a signal from your body. It's telling you something like even anxiety is so\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3578850, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's so awesome that more and more people are talking about anxiety disorders and everything\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3583730, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's it's a signal from your body. Yeah, pay attention\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3587570, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "I think that uh, we live in a\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3590690, "dDurationMs": 3760, "segs": [{"utf8": "We love a diagnosis because it tells us what's going on, but then we think we need to sit with it\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3594770, "dDurationMs": 5040, "segs": [{"utf8": "Okay. Well, that's that's my prison sentence. This is me. Yeah, but it's like here's a diagnosis. Here's this thing\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3599890, "dDurationMs": 4240, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's happening. Here's this thing that you're feeling. It's real. Look at it. Realize it cool. Now what now?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3604130, "dDurationMs": 1520, "segs": [{"utf8": "How do you make your life better? Exactly?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3605650, "dDurationMs": 1440, "segs": [{"utf8": "Or what is it telling you?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3607090, "dDurationMs": 5520, "segs": [{"utf8": "Is there things that you need to maybe step back on and focus on a little more or a little less or whatever it is\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3612690, "dDurationMs": 1360, "segs": [{"utf8": "um, you talked about\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3614050, "dDurationMs": 5040, "segs": [{"utf8": "When you got here, um, it reminded me of something that Simon Sinek said about like excitement versus nervousness\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3619170, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like the feeling the feeling if you separate the thoughts\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3622690, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "Just empty your thoughts whatever way you can you just feel that feeling\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3626450, "dDurationMs": 6160, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's super similar. If not the exact same feeling excitement versus nervousness Simon Sinek. Um, who's an author that I really like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3632610, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "He talks about uh\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3634690, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "This uh, he's like a leadership trainer too. He has a bunch of lectures on youtube if you want to check him out\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3638530, "dDurationMs": 880, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's fucking awesome\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3639410, "