 you were talking about when you when you got here\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3694740, "dDurationMs": 2080, "segs": [{"utf8": "You're you notice it as excitement now\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3697380, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "um\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3698580, "dDurationMs": 4080, "segs": [{"utf8": "If it was like 10 years ago and you were feeling nervous and you had to talk to your 10 years ago\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3702740, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "So what would you tell them like listen if this was 10 years ago?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3705940, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "I would have said no to doing the podcast because it's way outside of my comfort zone\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3709700, "dDurationMs": 2880, "segs": [{"utf8": "I don't I don't ever want to put myself good for you. I'm super glad you're here\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3712660, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, I don't want to sound foolish ever or like I don't want to talk about something that I don't know 100%\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3717860, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "But uh in that case none of us should be talking because we never know anything\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3722820, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "But um 10 years ago\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3725380, "dDurationMs": 2910, "segs": [{"utf8": "the now\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3728290, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "man\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3730290, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "The mind shift that I've had\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3733090, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Is very significant\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3735840, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "I mean 20 to 30 is a huge\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3738720, "dDurationMs": 1120, "segs": [{"utf8": "learning\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3739840, "dDurationMs": 1760, "segs": [{"utf8": "like age\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3741600, "dDurationMs": 2610, "segs": [{"utf8": "um\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3744210, "dDurationMs": 1810, "segs": [{"utf8": "so now\n"}]}, {"t