ple are perfect, you know, but some of us have far from that\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3802290, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, I've I've done some things. I'm not proud of\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3806130, "dDurationMs": 5920, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like can I necessarily make up for those things? No, but I can change my the way that I do everything\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3813410, "dDurationMs": 2580, "segs": [{"utf8": "and to me like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3815990, "dDurationMs": 3760, "segs": [{"utf8": "It does help me feel better about everything that I've gone through everything that I've done\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3819750, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "It led me to right where I'm at and from this point\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3823170, "dDurationMs": 4720, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's when I I have the power to make the choices that align with the life that I see for myself\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3827970, "dDurationMs": 2880, "segs": [{"utf8": "Right. I love that. I everyone has that power\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3831410, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, that uh, that's what I keep trying to like point out here\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3834130, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "Is is that moment when you're like you're on the trail\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3837570, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "And you're going on the trail then when you notice you're on the trail that right there\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3841250, "dDurationMs": 3920, "segs": [{"utf8": "The noticing is all it takes the noticing like okay. I'm on this trail like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3846290, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Where am I you know, like what is this trail? Do I want to go into the bushes over here?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3850130, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "Do I want to go check those out?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3851330, "dDurationMs": 5120, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like you can stop running on the trail for a dang second. Um, and this is a metaphor. We're not talking about hiking all of a sudden, but I\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3858290, "dDurationMs": 2350, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, that that\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3860640, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "I think that\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3862480, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "Joe Rogan has this thing. Um, I watched a lot of like motivational\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3866160, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "YouTube videos a lot of times I wake up and my depression tries to to strangle me a little bit\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3870720, "dDurationMs": 4720, "segs": [{"utf8": "And so the first thing I do is like nope ain't happening today. And so I put some like motivational stuff on\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3875600, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3876800, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "And again later just has a side note again later\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3879120, "dDurationMs": 2960, "segs": [{"utf8": "I look at like okay, it seems that maybe I was having some problems with sleep\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3882240, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's having some maybe maybe nightmares. Let's look at that. Maybe I was eating something wrong for bed\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3886560, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "It was kind of triggering these whatever so get curious. Yeah, so that's definitely a thing\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3889920, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "But but uh, the when I wake up the morning I put on these motivational videos\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3893840, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "There's one that I listened to Joe Rogan's voice actually and these people edited together\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3897840, "dDurationMs": 4080, "segs": [{"utf8": "Essentially they show have you seen the movie limitless with bradley cooper? No\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3902640, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "He take it's essentially they show him at the beginning of the movie and he's like imagine\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3906080, "dDura