y're punishing themselves for it\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3955520, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "But what you can do is you can wake up today\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3957840, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday, Saturday or Sunday, whatever day it is you can say I'm done with that\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3962480, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm I'm not doing that, you know, and I think that\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3966720, "dDurationMs": 6320, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like that that is one of the most powerful things that like a human can hear sometimes is like dude, whatever happened yesterday you can\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3973840, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "You can't rewind time unless you know how to build like a time machine. That's pretty intense\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3977440, "dDurationMs": 3920, "segs": [{"utf8": "But I think it's a great thing and I think it's empowering\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3981440, "dDurationMs": 5200, "segs": [{"utf8": "You know and it's given me a lot of power because I I have a lot of the saint like self hate thoughts and a lot of\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3986640, "dDurationMs": 4160, "segs": [{"utf8": "Self shame a lot of guilt a lot of a lot of things that everybody has, you know and\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3991360, "dDurationMs": 2880, "segs": [{"utf8": "But but what I what I say is is I come out here and I say\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3994800, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm not perfect and I haven't always been\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 3996800, "dDurationMs": 5280, "segs": [{"utf8": "Um, and I don't expect you to be but like you can say today is the first day of your hero's movie\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4002320, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "And you could start getting to work, you know, you could start clean one pan\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4006080, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "And you know if you have a sink full of dishes clean one pan, you know, whatever you got to do make that choice\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4010640, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4011840, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "um, I am pretty open and honest about like my depression as well and that's\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4016720, "dDurationMs": 4640, "segs": [{"utf8": "When it got really really really bad and I was having the suicidal thoughts and everything what\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4022520, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "What I realized then is it is about it's about choice again\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4025960, "dDurationMs": 4720, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like I there was too much to live for and too many people that would have been affected\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4031160, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "So I I felt like I wasn't going to make that choice. So since I'm not\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4035160, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "What choices could I make to help build me back up?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4038520, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I was on a really long drive when I was at my lowest point\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4043000, "dDurationMs": 3520, "segs": [{"utf8": "But when I got to my destination, that's when I went to the grocery store\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4047240, "dDurationMs": 5520, "segs": [{"utf8": "I got the proper foods. I got water. I sat down and I started writing\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4053800, "dDurationMs": 1040, "segs": [{"utf8": "I wrote\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4054840, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's where like action comes into play\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4057400, "dDurationMs": 6720, "segs": [{"utf8": "Um, and that is so important to sit there and be curious like why do I feel this way not just repeating I'm\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4065030, "dDurationMs": 5280, "segs": [{"utf8": "Broken I'm sad. I can't do this like that that constant repetition you start to truly\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4070870, "dDurationMs": 3760, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's your identity. You believe it. It's it is your belief. It is your experiment. Yeah\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4075110, "dDurationMs": 4400, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, oh the second part of that quote that I said where your beliefs and your experiences coexist\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4080230, "dDurationMs": 3360, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, um, all experiences are available at all times\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4085140, "dDurationMs": 4720, "segs": [{"utf8": "Oh, I love that. That's something right on your wall. Yeah, I definitely need that on the wall because we forget\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4090420, "dDurationMs": 5120, "segs": [{"utf8": "We forget that all experiences are available at all times. If you are on your rock bottom, you don't have to stay there\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4096320, "dDurationMs": 4480, "segs": [{"utf8": "You can feel those things but then you can also self analyze and that's what I did on a piece of paper\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4100800, "dDurationMs": 5360, "segs": [{"utf8": "I wrote down every single thing that was overwhelming to me that I felt that I had failed at that I just\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4107040, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "Um, like a bad list almost\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4109840, "dDurationMs": 4720, "segs": [{"utf8": "I just needed to get it out on paper and look at it and like that doesn't seem very constructive\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4114960, "dDurationMs": 1760, "segs": [{"utf8": "What the next part is\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4116720, "dDurationMs": 5040, "segs": [{"utf8": "On the flip side of the paper. I literally wrote what to do about it each bullet point\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4122080, "dDurationMs": 4480, "segs": [{"utf8": "I found a solution for and then from that day, which was only\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4127920, "dDurationMs": 5680, "segs": [{"utf8": "That was last may it was kind of like after the diagnosis and that it can't there was a lot more to the diagnosis\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4133600, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "and just being told that it's like family stuff, but\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4136870, "dDurationMs": 2960, "segs": [{"utf8": "When I was at my absolute low point\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4141160, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "That was the only way that I could try to get better\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4143960, "dDurationMs": 3520, "segs": [{"utf8": "I was like, okay. What I'm doing is not working anymore. What could I do different?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4147800, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "And that's what I made that list not every day\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4149960, "dDurationMs": 5200, "segs": [{"utf8": "I looked at the I looked at all the things and then I would flip the paper over and what could I do about it\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4155640, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I started to do those things and pretty soon on the the bad side\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4160340, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "Started getting crossed off because they were non-existent\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4163700, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, that's the crazy at that\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4165700, "dDurationMs": 4480, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's something that went when uh that when you realize like oh shoot like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4170960, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's only been two weeks or it's been two months or whatever and like I actually don't do that thing anymore\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4174800, "dDurationMs": 4160, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like I actually don't have that thought or I like something that you literally two months ago or two weeks ago\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4178960, "dDurationMs": 6000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Whatever it was before you wrote it down like that's your identity like that's a daily thought like sometimes self-hate thought\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4185600, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "You're not worthy thought whatever it may be or like just trying to conceptualize it\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4190820, "dDurationMs": 4080, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's it's crazy to see that you could unwind that I had a thing that I wrote that was uh\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4195540, "dDurationMs": 5520, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like it was essentially like a dream list. It was like one day. I want to like do this like this is my perfect day\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4201620, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "Um, and it was like a it was like a pipe dream when I wrote it\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4204740, "dDurationMs": 4720, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I actually had put it up on the wall and I had so much shit on the wall that I like a bunch of those thoughts\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4209940, "dDurationMs": 880, "segs": [{"utf8": "Um\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4210820, "dDurationMs": 4240, "segs": [{"utf8": "And a few months later I went back through and it was like a weird moment like before I went to bed\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4215060, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'd grabbed it off the wall. I didn't even plan on it and I was just like glancing at it\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4218260, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "I don't even know like what led me to do this and I was I had this like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4222100, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "Just softening and my whole body. I was reading it and just started balling\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4225140, "dDurationMs": 5680, "segs": [{"utf8": "I was like, oh my god. I did all these things today and like it was it was down to silly things for me. I was like, uh, you know, like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4231860, "dDurationMs": 5840, "segs": [{"utf8": "Uh, record a podcast with this, but you know something like even just little goals, but also mental things. Um,\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4238610, "dDurationMs": 2230, "segs": [{"utf8": "I think\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4240840, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "I gotta ask you something. Do you think that writing is magic because I think that writing is actual magic?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4245560, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, what okay, so obviously I was writing random letters love letters\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4250280, "dDurationMs": 4960, "segs": [{"utf8": "And what would happen is anytime we'd have like a disagreement or something. I would I would take to\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4256120, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "Writing and then because my hand would just move\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4259320, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "Very quickly and I would just pour it onto the paper. I actually learned a lot about myself\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4263640, "dDurationMs": 4240, "segs": [{"utf8": "It helped me figure out issues and then I feel like putting pen to paper it\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4268440, "dDurationMs": 2410, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's your reality\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4271010, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "What I was doing was my reality\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4272690, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "It was taking all my thoughts and putting on paper and then I could actually read it back to myself\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4276290, "dDurationMs": 1360, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm like, ah\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4277650, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "Do I like the story that I'm creating for myself?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4281300, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like we'll know we have the option to create a different one\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4285680, "dDurationMs": 2150, "segs": [{"utf8": "how do you\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4287830, "dDurationMs": 1120, "segs": [{"utf8": "the\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4288950, "dDurationMs": 5520, "segs": [{"utf8": "How do you I'm just trying to think of like people who write it down and they're like, okay. What does this do? I'm trying\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4294470, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "How do you separate?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4297920, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "How do you okay? So you write something down?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 4301430, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm just trying to think I feel like we're not write something down. You almost\n"}]}, {"tStar