s": 5082680, "dDurationMs": 4880, "segs": [{"utf8": "Following my history uh like of my family my family tree like there's just like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5088200, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "depression suicide\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5090440, "dDurationMs": 1040, "segs": [{"utf8": "um\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5091480, "dDurationMs": 7440, "segs": [{"utf8": "Mental breakdowns like it's just on both sides. It's everywhere and I had a few homies over last night or uh like last week\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5099320, "dDurationMs": 800, "segs": [{"utf8": ". We had a few beers\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5100120, "dDurationMs": 5120, "segs": [{"utf8": "We had a we had a podcast and we were started talking we got on this page of like all three of us in this room had like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5105880, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "Very similar experiences when we were young like we started talking about those\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5110440, "dDurationMs": 5120, "segs": [{"utf8": "And we we kind of had this moment of pride where we're like, you know what we're fucking breaking that though\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5115640, "dDurationMs": 5200, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like we're not like yeah, our dads did that to us. Yeah, yeah our our family had that happen\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5122040, "dDurationMs": 4160, "segs": [{"utf8": "But but hey guys like we're in this room breaking that cycle\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5126680, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "um in a lot of times that there's books and there's all these things of like breaking the the\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5131640, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "trans dimensional curse or whatever i'm using words like the\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5136680, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "Breaking a family curse essentially like you you have these things like my family's always been like this\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5140680, "dDurationMs": 3760, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I was taught how to be like this since I was 15 or whatever\n"}]}, {"tStart