f from that wrong thing you said. Yeah, or you just you just keep pushing pushing pushing like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5205320, "dDurationMs": 4160, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's that's a family thing for me. And yeah, it takes a lot of effort\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5210120, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "To break the cycle, but it is possible\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5212200, "dDurationMs": 4880, "segs": [{"utf8": "And that's one of those things about being able to step outside yourself and ask like was that the best reaction?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5217860, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "Or actually pay attention to how it affected the person that you're talking to\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5221700, "dDurationMs": 5440, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like oh, I saw that that hurt them like crap that might have been my intention, but I don't like how it feels\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5228120, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's an opportunity for you to like shut your mouth for one second\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5232200, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "Sit there in that feeling and then make a choice\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5236280, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "To correct it. That's the first step\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5240660, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "I agree. I think\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5242950, "dDurationMs": 6320, "segs": [{"utf8": "Gosh, it just keeps everything we've been saying just comes back to like this noticing that that awareness like that moment of like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5249670, "dDurationMs": 6560, "segs": [{"utf8": "Give yourself a second. Yeah, notice it acknowledge it. And then if you feel like it's not suiting you anymore\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5257650, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "Change it if you don't know how reach out for help\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5261570, "dDurationMs": 4080, "segs": [{"utf8": "Or do the research on the internet or ask a friend or ask the person that you're talking to\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5266130, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "I have to do that because I was raised in a really rigid home\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5269810, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "So I have those rigid habits of my own and I would didn't\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5273410, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "I wasn't allowed to make a lot of choices growing up that were made for me\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5277170, "dDurationMs": 3760, "segs": [{"utf8": "And so as an adult when I make one that's it. No one can change my mind\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5281250, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "So all I am doing is repeating the cycle\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5283570, "dDurationMs": 1360, "segs": [{"utf8": "So now when I\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5284930, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "Even though it's my habit to be that way and I feel like I can't possibly have a conversation\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5289250, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "I have to be so like this is what I want. This is my choice\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5292130, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "You can't tell me not to do it or change my mind in any way\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5296050, "dDurationMs": 4080, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'm I see the reaction on my husband's face and and then I'm like, okay\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5302020, "dDurationMs": 2420, "segs": [{"utf8": "Can I try that again?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5304600, "dDurationMs": 4240, "segs": [{"utf8": "And that's what breaks the cycle is just by simply asking like can I try that again?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5309160, "dDurationMs": 2640, "segs": [{"utf8": "And how does he does he leave you room for these? Absolutely\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5312520, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "I think that's the receiving side is a huge thing\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5314840, "dDurationMs": 3520, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like if you're on the other side of someone like clearly like you love this person\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5318360, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "And they're just a little frustrated. They're trying to figure out what they think\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5321160, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "And you know, sometimes we say things we don't mean sometimes\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5323400, "dDurationMs": 2960, "segs": [{"utf8": "We like kind of mean what we say it or whatever an argument or something\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5326600, "dDurationMs": 5440, "segs": [{"utf8": "But I love that he's like willing to like allow you to like the room to say like, all right\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5332040, "dDurationMs": 5120, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, let's redo that. Yeah, he's granted me so much room to grow as a person whereas\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5337720, "dDurationMs": 5360, "segs": [{"utf8": "My past relationship not so much, you know, like this is it's so nice having a partner that's always\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5343640, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "Trying to be better themselves too. So we do give each other that leniency to grow\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5348760, "dDurationMs": 4720, "segs": [{"utf8": "And sometimes one of us is sitting there while the other person is like doing growth\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5354120, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "And then we're not completely on the same level, but then we sit down and talk about that too\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5358360, "dDurationMs": 4160, "segs": [{"utf8": "And that's I don't know it's all about communication and recognizing what's going on and then\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5363400, "dDurationMs": 4800, "segs": [{"utf8": "Um just when it comes to the family cycles and stuff if you don't like how things are\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5368840, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": ", if you don't like how it feels\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5372450, "dDurationMs": 2230, "segs": [{"utf8": "You can change it\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5374680, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "You can get up you can stand up and you can do something differently\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5377480, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8":