gs": [{"utf8": "That's it too if the if you're standing there and you're not quite sure what the other person means\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5436450, "dDurationMs": 6480, "segs": [{"utf8": "Ask right don't assume that you know what someone is trying to say if it's not completely clear right ask questions\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5443010, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "Be curious. Yeah, I have conversations\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5446130, "dDurationMs": 4880, "segs": [{"utf8": "Gosh in being able to ask questions. So this is another we're shifting from that position for that person\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5453170, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "The receiving end so someone is talking like asking questions. Okay, you don't understand it\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5457010, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "You're on the receiving end someone's trying to explain to you you're a little frustrated\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5459810, "dDurationMs": 3760, "segs": [{"utf8": "You're like, what are you trying to say here? You're on the receiving end of this conversation listener?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5464370, "dDurationMs": 2230, "segs": [{"utf8": "I think\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5466600, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Realizing that a lot of us have\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5470420, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Places that we're coming from we have\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5473010, "dDurationMs": 2550, "segs": [{"utf8": "pre-opposed\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5476280, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "What's the word I'm looking for\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5479320, "dDurationMs": 2960, "segs": [{"utf8": "When a homeless man walks up to you, this is going to be a stretch of hanging with me\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5482920, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "The homeless man walks up to you versus when your mom walks up to you think about your body language\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5487800, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "So when a homeless man walks up, but you're like not totally comfortable\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5490280, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "You know, maybe he like doesn't give the appearance that he's well kept that he's had he's well-said\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5494440, "dDurationMs": 4400, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like you know, these are obvious things. I'm not saying it's a judgment on the on the homeless man, but we have\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5499640, "dDurationMs": 1760, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, we have\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5501400, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "Areas that we come with so when we're talking to the homeless man\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5504280, "dDurationMs": 4080, "segs": [{"utf8": "It is going to be a different side of our like mind like a different conversation a different\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5508920, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Place we're sitting in\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5511000, "dDurationMs": 5280, "segs": [{"utf8": "Um than it is if our mom's talking to us, you know, like there's or someone that you love that you're talking to\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5516680, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "You're going to leave them so much room because you're like, I know you so well\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5519880, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "I know that you don't mean to hurt me with what you're saying\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5521960, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "But a lot of times when it's a homeless person they walk up to you and they say\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5525560, "dDurationMs": 2640, "segs": [{"utf8": "Hey, this thing you automatically say whatever they're saying is just\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5528920, "dDurationMs": 5120, "segs": [{"utf8": "Selfish or it's whatever you don't you don't leave them the same room as someone you love as you're judging them. Yeah\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5535080, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "It's that immediate judgment like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5537160, "dDurationMs": 4400, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, I think we have different judgments on different types of people different\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5542040, "dDurationMs": 4480, "segs": [{"utf8": "Situations in our life. I had a small video on my youtube that was uh picking up a piece of trash\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5547000, "dDurationMs": 1200, "segs": [{"utf8": "And it was like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5548200, "dDurationMs": 2880, "segs": [{"utf8": "The way that I in the piece of trash was a coffee cup\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5551560, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "The way that I held would hold a coffee cup. That's mine\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5554520, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "Is warm and I want my fingers to really feel it and I love it and I hold it close to my body\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5559160, "dDurationMs": 4240, "segs": [{"utf8": "But when I picked up a piece of trash in this youtube video, um, this is also just I wanted to tell everybody\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5563400, "dDurationMs": 1120, "segs": [{"utf8": "I pick up trash\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5564520, "dDurationMs": 2640, "segs": [{"utf8": "But uh, but I picked up the trash and I was holding it with two fingers\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5567160, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "And I wasn't wasn't fully touching it because it's so much it's garbage, right?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5570040, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "But it's a coffee cup. It's the exact same thing that if I purchased it with my own money\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5573480, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "I'd be holding it close to my heart. Do you be gripping it? I'd be feeling the warmth of the coffee\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5577640, "dDurationMs": 2960, "segs": [{"utf8": "But when we pick up a piece of trash, we're kind of like like we hold the way\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5581160, "dDurationMs": 3760, "segs": [{"utf8": "I think that we treat conversations like this sometimes we come we come to the conversation\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5585480, "dDurationMs": 4160, "segs": [{"utf8": "Not assuming the other person's trash, but we're we're kind of holding them with two fingers\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5589880, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "They kind of outwards like oh like you're saying this thing\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5592920, "dDurationMs": 960, "segs": [{"utf8": "But um\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5593880, "dDurationMs": 3520, "segs": [{"utf8": "And if it starts to make sense now like that's kind of like the way we treat a homeless person\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5597480, "dDurationMs": 3360, "segs": [{"utf8": "But when it's your cup of coffee, it's someone you love you give them the grace\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5601240, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "You give them the room that they need to tell you like oh shoot. I didn't mean to say that or I I mean the\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5606120, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Here's my intention\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5608120, "dDurationMs": 7120, "segs": [{"utf8": "Some people are the opposite too because when it's family, you know them so you can be more aggressive or more assertive and then\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5615800, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "They're just supposed to deal with it or if it was a stranger\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5618360, "dDurationMs": 4160, "segs": [{"utf8": "You might have more compassion because you don't want to be seen in a certain way. We do flip that all\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5623240, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "Yeah, it's that's in every situation we ever talk about there is multiple\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5627320, "dDurationMs": 7280, "segs": [{"utf8": "Perspectives to have but it's not interesting. Yeah, so that's when it's just about being curious when you feel yourself have any kind of emotion\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5634680, "dDurationMs": 1280, "segs": [{"utf8": "whether it's um\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5635960, "dDurationMs": 6960, "segs": [{"utf8": "Scared of a bear or you're fearful or like questioning why a homeless person would be like approaching you or your mom\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5643560, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "Walks in the room lovingly like no matter what it is if you're just curious\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5647000, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Just if you feel yourself feel a thing\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5649000, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Just get curious about what it means\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5651720, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "Because so many so many times we can paint ourselves into these corners of not\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5655160, "dDurationMs": 4080, "segs": [{"utf8": "Of thinking they mean this thing or thinking they're assuming this but it's like, okay, wait\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5659560, "dDurationMs": 2640, "segs": [{"utf8": "I know that you're you're a good person. You don't mean me harm with what you're saying\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5662280, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "It seems like what you just said was a little intense like what\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5665160, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "Like let let them have some room to reword it if they want to you know, yes\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5668840, "dDurationMs": 4800, "segs": [{"utf8": "Um, and that comes full circle with the repeating the family stuff too is like often with your family\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5673640, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "You're comfortable to act like a little shit sometimes sometimes\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5676840, "dDurationMs": 6240, "segs": [{"utf8": "Right a total brat. Yeah, and what about with your loved ones? Like is it okay to vent your whole day to them?\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5683720, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Hmm like and to take it out on them\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5686360, "dDurationMs": 1360, "segs": [{"utf8": "Right\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5687720, "dDurationMs": 1760, "segs": [{"utf8": "That's a good one. That's a good one\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5689480, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "So do you ever do that like when you had a bad day\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5691160, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "You just want to like get a hold of your loved one and just tell them everything about it and just like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5698870, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "Because there's a balance of\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5700870, "dDurationMs": 2890, "segs": [{"utf8": "Just having someone that you can share\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5704400, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "At all times I think facebook does this for us when soon as something bad happens\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5707760, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "We have a place that we can go vent about that bad thing the\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5712080, "dDurationMs": 5520, "segs": [{"utf8": "Both of my career fields whether it's hairdressing and the coaching. Um, there's confidentiality behind that\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5718160, "dDurationMs": 4960, "segs": [{"utf8": "So like yes the day could weigh very heavy on me, but I can't repeat it\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5723520, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "So if I need to get it out there like to my husband\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5725920, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "I will say do not ask me any questions. Do not ask me who it is. Just listen to this\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5731280, "dDurationMs": 5360, "segs": [{"utf8": "Um, if the weight got too heavy on my back, but then there's another little tidbit a little tidbit\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5736640, "dDurationMs": 880, "segs": [{"utf8": "for you guys\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5737520, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "If you are in a career field\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5739840, "dDurationMs": 3920, "segs": [{"utf8": "Where you carry a lot of weight from other people's stories or if like\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5744240, "dDurationMs": 4240, "segs": [{"utf8": "You're around certain people that steal your energy or just add a lot to your plate\n"}]}, {"tStartMs": 5749040, "dDurationMs": 3360, "segs": [{"utf8": "Um, I don't remember who came up with this but the threshold theory\n"}]}, {"tStartM